<title>JAPAN: Ishigaki Foods -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ishigaki Foods -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		782    million	  vs	  974    million</p>
<p> Operating	   66    million	  vs	  113    million</p>
<p> Current	     63    million	  vs	  103    million</p>
<p> Net		   35    million	  vs	   46    million</p>
<p> EPS		   15.72 yen	  vs	   20.67 yen</p>
<p> Shares		2 million	  vs	   2 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishigaki Foods Co Ltd makes instant drinks and dried foods.</p>
</text>
